#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/distribute-a-custom-desktop-app.rst:7
msgid ""
"You can customize and distribute your own Mattermost desktop application "
"by configuring `src/common/config/buildConfig.ts "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/desktop/blob/master/src/common/config/buildConfig.ts>`__."
msgstr ""
"`src/common/config/buildConfig.ts "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/desktop/blob/master/src/common/config/buildConfig.ts>`__\\ "
"를 구성하여 자체 OKR.BEST 데스크톱 애플리케이션을 커스터마이징하고 배포할 수 "
"있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/distribute-a-custom-desktop-app.rst:9
msgid ""
"Configure the desktop app's ``buildConfig.ts`` file. You can configure "
"the following parameters to customize the user experience, including "
"`defaultTeams <#defaultTeams>`__, `helpLink <#helpLink>`__, and "
"`enableServerManagement <#enableServerManagement>`__."
msgstr ""
"데스크톱 앱의 ``buildConfig.ts`` 파일을 구성합니다. `defaultTeams "
"<#defaultTeams>`__, `helpLink <#helpLink>`__, `enableServerManagement "
"<#enableServerManagement>`__\\ 을 포함한 다음 매개 변수를 구성하여 사용자 "
"경험을 커스터마이징할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/distribute-a-custom-desktop-app.rst:11
msgid ""
"Follow the `Mattermost Desktop Development Guide "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/contribute/more-info/desktop"
"/developer-setup/>`__ to build the application."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost Desktop 개발 가이드 "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/contribute/more-info/desktop/developer-"
"setup/>`__\\ 를 따라 애플리케이션을 빌드합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/distribute-a-custom-desktop-app.rst:12
msgid "Distribute the application to your users."
msgstr "애플리케이션을 사용자에게 배포합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/distribute-a-custom-desktop-app.rst:15
msgid "``defaultTeams``"
msgstr "``defaultTeams``"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/distribute-a-custom-desktop-app.rst:17
msgid ""
"List of server URLs and their display names added to the desktop app by "
"default, which the user cannot modify. Users can still add servers "
"`through the Server Management page <#enableservermanagement>`_ unless "
"``enableServerManagement`` is set to ``false``. Expects an array of key-"
"value pairs."
msgstr ""
"기본적으로 데스크톱 앱에 추가되며 사용자가 수정할 수 없는 서버 URL과 표시명 "
"목록입니다. ``enableServerManagement``\\ 가 ``false``\\ 로 설정되어 있지 "
"않으면 사용자는 여전히 `서버 관리 페이지를 통해 <#enableservermanagement>`_ "
"서버를 추가할 수 있습니다. 키-값 쌍의 배열을 기대합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/distribute-a-custom-desktop-app.rst:19
#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/distribute-a-custom-desktop-app.rst:39
